@format 1
@id ui-event.split-current-lock-change
@title Split source lock change
@section I. UI
@area UI event
@tabs Split
@event-ref cs|PMainArea/PSplitTab.cs|PSplitTab|pList|PListLockChange|1
@entry input
@summary Prevent section mutations and sidecar writes while the current Split source is locked.
@tag source lock
@tag PSplitTab
@alias tab = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PSplitTab
@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow

[input] Current Split source lock changes <input>
- Receive the current list item's locked state through the constructor registration @ tab.PSplitTab
> apply

[apply] Synchronize section editability <process>
- Disable section mutations and their sidecar-save path while locked, and restore them when unlocked @ flow.PFlowEditSet
> output

[output] Timeline edit state synchronized <output>
= Existing sections remain visible and selectable, but a submitted source cannot be changed until the list is cleared.
! Code binding: cs|PMainArea/PSplitTab.cs|PSplitTab|pList|PListLockChange|1
